      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A short-duration annealing treatment can selectively recrystallize the soft phase while leaving the hard phase recovered rather than recrystallized.",
